                content:
                  "Dedicated servers tend to be more expensive than VPS, as the user is paying for exclusive access to the server's hardware. However, the investment is justified by the performance and security offered.",
              },
            ],
          },
        },
      ],
    },
  },
  "vps-xeon": {
    title: "Intel Xeon VPS",
    long: "Virtual Private Server",
    images: {
      left: cpu,
      right: ok,
    },
    products: {
      top: productsPreview[5] as Products,
      full: products[5] as Products,
    },
    vs: {
      label: "Intel Xeon VPS and AMD Ryzen VPS",
      content: [
        {
          title: "Intel Xeon VPS",
          perf: {
            performance: 40,
            customization: 40,
            price: 10,
            text: [
              {
                title: "Performance",
                content:
                  "Intel Xeon VPS are budget-friendly options that offer shared hardware resources with other users. These servers feature less powerful processors compared to higher-end VPS options, making them unsuitable for high-resource applications. However, they are sufficient for many applications, websites, automation bots ecc...",
              },
              {
                title: "Customization",
                content:
                  "Even though they are cost-effective, Intel Xeon VPS still provide a good level of customization. Users can install and configure their own operating system and software. The management of these servers is facilitated by user-friendly control panels, offering a decent level of control and flexibility.",
