              },
            ],
          },
        },
        {
          title: "AMD Ryzen VPS",
          perf: {
            performance: 50,
            customization: 40,
            price: 20,
            text: [
              {
                title: "Performance",
                content:
                  "AMD Ryzen VPS servers share physical resources with other users, but thanks to virtualization, each VPS has guaranteed resources. This setup provides a good balance between cost and performance, making it suitable for many medium-sized applications. Ryzen 9 processors are known for their robust performance, offering a significant improvement over budget options.",
              },
              {
                title: "Customization",
                content:
                  "AMD Ryzen VPS offers a high degree of customization, similar to Intel Xeon VPS. Users can install and configure their own operating system and software. Management is typically simplified by intuitive control panels like Virtualizor, making it easier to handle various administrative tasks.",
              },
              {
                title: "Price",
                content:
                  "While more expensive than Intel Xeon VPS, AMD Ryzen VPS still costs less than dedicated servers because the physical resources are shared among multiple users. This makes it an economical solution for those who need flexibility and good performance without the overhead of managing an entire physical server.",
              },
            ],
          },
        },
      ],
    },
  },
  vds: {
    title: "AMD Ryzen VDS",
    long: "Virtual Dedicated Server",
    images: {
      left: cpu,
      right: ok,
    },
    products: {
      top: productsPreview[1] as Products,
      full: products[1] as Products,
    },
    vs: {
      label: "Dedicated and VDS Servers",
      content: [
        {
          title: "VDS",
          perf: {
            performance: 70,
            customization: 60,
            price: 40,
            text: [
              {
                title: "Performance",
                content:
                  "VDS Performance servers offer dedicated and guaranteed hardware resources, ensuring excellent performance for more demanding applications. With the latest generation processors, these VDS are ideal for intensive workloads.",
              },
              {
                title: "Customization",
                content:
                  "A VDS Performance allows for advanced customization, enabling users to configure the operating system and software according to their needs. Resource management is simple and intuitive through advanced control panels.",
              },
              {
