                content:
                  "The cost of a VDS Performance is higher than that of a cheap VDS, reflecting the superior quality of the hardware and guaranteed performance. However, it is a worthwhile investment for those who need high performance and reliability.",
              },
            ],
          },
        },
        {
          title: "Dedicated",
          perf: {
            performance: 100,
            customization: 100,
            price: 80,
            text: [
              {
                title: "Performance",
                content:
                  "With a dedicated server, the hardware resources are entirely available to a single user, ensuring maximum performance without the risk of congestion caused by other users. This is ideal for resource-intensive applications.",
              },
              {
                title: "Customization",
                content:
                  "Customization on a dedicated server is total. The user can configure every aspect of the server, from the operating system to the installed software, tailoring the work environment to their specific needs.",
              },
              {
                title: "Price",
                content:
                  "Dedicated servers tend to be more expensive than VPS, as the user is paying for exclusive access to the server's hardware. However, the investment is justified by the performance and security offered.",
              },
            ],
          },
        },
      ],
    },
  },
  "vds-xeon": {
    title: "Intel Xeon VDS",
    long: "Virtual Dedicated Server",
    images: {
      left: cpu,
      right: ok,
    },
    products: {
      top: productsPreview[6] as Products,
      full: products[6] as Products,
    },
    vs: {
      label: "VDS Cheap and VDS Performance",
      content: [
        {
          title: "Intel Xeon VDS",
          perf: {
            performance: 40,
