                content:
                  " The cost of an Intel Xeon VDS is relatively low, making it an attractive option for those seeking dedicated resources on a budget. It is a cost-effective solution for less resource-intensive applications while still providing the reliability of dedicated virtual resources.",
              },
            ],
          },
        },
        {
          title: "AMD Ryzen VDS",
          perf: {
            performance: 70,
            customization: 60,
            price: 40,
            text: [
              {
                title: "Performance",
                content:
                  "AMD Ryzen VDS offers dedicated virtual resources with powerful Ryzen 9 processors. This setup guarantees robust performance and is suitable for medium to high-demand applications. AMD Ryzen VDS provides a significant performance boost compared to budget options, making it ideal for more intensive tasks.",
